From b4e5a1eeb6d868722c50e771fba7cfa59e75645b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: slopdealer <326519127+slopdealer@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 14:30:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/49] R10 (cmd/restic): the debug log no longer selects
 another code path; gofmt

internalOpenWithLockedWaitWork dropped the wait work, and check its
overlapped structure pass, whenever DEBUG_LOG was set, to keep debug lines in
their usual order. A user who turned the debug log on to look into a problem
of the overlapped path then ran the other path and could not see it. Both
switches are removed (backup's was removed with the repair); debug lines of
the wait work may now interleave with those of the lock code.

check_structure_overlap.go and backup_progress_publication_test.go are
reformatted with gofmt; no other change in them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 cmd/restic/backup_progress_publication_test.go | 4 ++--
 cmd/restic/check_structure_overlap.go          | 6 +++---
 cmd/restic/cmd_check.go                        | 3 +--
 cmd/restic/lock.go                             | 7 -------
 4 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

